(396, '<p><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">1).color changed on calander</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\" /><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">2).featured now looking better</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\" /><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">3). on loadmore slider issue resolve</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\" /><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">4). made a new template for&nbsp;</span><span class=\"p-member_profile_hover_card\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; width: fit-content; height: fit-content; display: inline-flex; color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\" role=\"presentation\"><a class=\"c-link c-member_slug c-member_slug--light c-member_slug--link\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; border-radius: 3px; padding: 0px