(425, '<h2>Today work:<br /><br /></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #0d0d0d; font-family: S&ouml;hne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">I have created a post and uploaded it on all social media accounts.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #0d0d0d; font-family: S&ouml;hne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">I have spent some time on other office work assigned by Rashid sir.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #0d0d0d; font-family: S&ouml;hne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">I have dedicated time to searching for Upwork jobs for proposal.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #0d0d0d; font-family: S&ouml;hne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">I have conducted R&amp;D on Fiverr to identify additional job opportunities.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Ahmed Bilal | Business Developer</p>', '<p>I will discuss tomorrow.</p>', 4, 66, '2024-02-21 21:26:39', '2024-02-21 21:26:39'),
(426, '<p>Tommorow i will done the API of price labe on click<br />on some functionality i work on auto run API.<br />-&gt; Regard Muhammad Sadiq</p>', '<p>Today i will work on auto API system</p>', 48, 13, '2024-02-22 08:06:33', '2024-02-22 08:06:33'),
