(439, '<p>Today i watch the wordpress tutorial and also practice on them</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Mehtab Altaf | Junior Dev | sainmehtab15@gmail.com | 03146634665</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>tommorow i also watch the tutorial and complete my wordpress</p>', 67, 27, '2024-02-24 19:27:47', '2024-02-24 19:27:47'),
(440, '<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;\">Daily Updates</span>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;\">Today i create a read documentation of wordpress and create a page in wordpress</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;\">I show my posts in the form of card on this page when i click on the cards it open to the detail page</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;\">Today i read all the function of elementor and install other required plugins</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">Today i watch tutorial for wordpress</span></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #000000;\">Khurshid Bilal | Junior Dev | khurshid@webpenter.com | 0301-2648886</span></p>', '<p>Tommorow i will try to learn more</p>', 67, 38, '2024-02-24 19:34:21', '2024-02-24 19:34:21'),
(441, '<p>Update:<br /><br /></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Did R&amp;D on agencies&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>did testing of 2 client websites&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>gave class</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Ayub Khokhar&nbsp;<br /></strong>Front-End Developer | Team Lead | webpenter.LLC</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>follow the same routine&nbsp;</p>', 4, 3, '2024-02-24 19:54:42', '2024-02-24 19:54:42'),
(442, '<p><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">1). Service fee is only visible to admin...</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\" /><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">2). Load more search issue...</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\" /><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">3). pushed and check the price labs work</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\" /><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">4). Some css conflict resolved.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\" /><span style=\"color: #1d1c1d; font-family: Slack-Lato, Slack-Fractions, appleLogo, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-variant-ligatures: common-ligatures; background-color: #f8f8f8;\">Today update...<br /></span>Regard-&gt; Muhammad Sadiq</p>', '<p>Tommorw just need to give him update work also done</p>', 48, 13, '2024-02-26 18:15:03', '2024-02-26 18:15:03'),
(443, '<p>Good Evening,</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>wokred on client feedback (footer issue + sidebar)</li>\r\n<li>give class on objects in js</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Waqar Hussain | Junior Web Developer</p>', '<p>I will work on:</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>client feedbacks</li>\r\n<li>waiting for new work</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>thanks</p>', 82, 16, '2024-02-26 19:55:58', '2024-02-26 19:55:58'),
(444, '<p>Today Update:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>worked on website of client with khurshid</li>\r\n<li>worked on agency websites&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>gave lectures to students&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>worked on portfolio website&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Ayub Khokhar&nbsp;<br /></strong>Front-End Developer | Team Lead | webpenter.LLC</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>will contiue same flow</p>', 4, 3, '2024-02-26 20:11:08', '2024-02-26 20:11:08');
