(464, '<ul>\r\n<li>Did Budgeting for multiple projects with Zahid bhai and developers and sent to clients&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>did quality assurance for mobile app</li>\r\n<li>Gave class to student in boys academy</li>\r\n<li>worked on various issues in daily routine like mailing clients adressing issues&nbsp;<br /><br /></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Ayub Khokhar&nbsp;<br /></strong>Front-End Developer | Team Lead | webpenter.LLC</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>will continue the flow</p>', 4, 3, '2024-03-05 20:42:14', '2024-03-05 20:42:14'),
