(474, '<p>Tooba Khursheed l Junior Developer&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>In today\'s class I have learned about basics of php .</li>\r\n<li>Difference between html and php.</li>\r\n<li>What is server site and how an application transfer to browser .</li>\r\n<li>Sir had given us all lecture on white board .</li>\r\n</ol>', '<p>Learn more about php .</p>', 91, 81, '2024-03-12 01:15:20', '2024-03-12 01:15:20'),
(475, '<p>Tooba Khursheed l Junior Developer&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>In today\'s class I have learned about basics of php .</li>\r\n<li>Difference between html and php.</li>\r\n<li>What is server site and how an application transfer to browser .</li>\r\n<li>Sir had given us all lecture on white board .</li>\r\n</ol>', '<p>Learn more about php .</p>', 91, 81, '2024-03-12 01:15:21', '2024-03-12 01:15:21'),
(476, '<p>Tooba Khursheed l Junior Developer&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>In today\'s class I learned about the difference between static and dynamic .&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>Html is a static page and php is a dynamic page .</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #008000;\">static : when we put any code in static page it can never changed like that .</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #00ccff;\">Dynamic : It comes from your data base and it is a php page .&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #00ccff;\">I learn about loop run process .</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"background-color: #00ccff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">Php :</span></span></strong><span style=\"background-color: #00ccff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\"> It has server for run .</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color: #00ccff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">We add anything like html css java type in php but in html code we just use html and css .&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color: #00ccff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">&lt; It is a starting tag for php .</span></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"background-color: #00ccff;\"><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff;\">&gt; It is a ending tag for php .</span></span></p>\r\n<p>Php is a open source language and widely used language&nbsp; .</p>\r\n<p>Sir had given us all lecture in white board .</p>\r\n<p><strong>Overall today\'s class is good .</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p>Learn more about php .</p>', 91, 81, '2024-03-12 14:27:16', '2024-03-12 14:27:16');
