(677, '<ul>\r\n<li>Deliver lecture on React Native Navigation</li>\r\n<li>Working to create sample app to add google signin from last 4 days. Issue is that we cannot test app without building the app (not using expo go) so we make build using free tire so some time it take more then an hour.</li>\r\n<li>In Sample App we able to logedin using google and firebase&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li>now im trying to integrate in HMA&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Ahmad Raza | Full Stack Developer | ahmedraza4119@gmail.com | 0309-3461901</p>', '<ul>\r\n<li>Deliver lecture on React Native Navigation</li>\r\n</ul>', 4, 2, '2024-06-07 20:21:25', '2024-06-07 20:21:25'),
